  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IlQUasR.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1640\" height=\"664\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>在《我的世界》中佩戴火影的護額（頭帶）！<br></strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>護額可進行合成，因此此模組支援生存模式<br><em>（向下捲動查看合成配方）</em></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>裝備後將獲得額外力量，並在角色周圍產生粒子特效</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>模組內建火影忍者相關音效</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>非常適合角色扮演與生存伺服器，或是單純想體驗看看的玩家！</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/narutos-hitai-ate/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rSZhRit.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"279\" height=\"89\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HbVCqo0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1663\" height=\"977\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AvXPiP9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1663\" height=\"977\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1277328053831336062/1277328351069077544/2024-08-25_18.29.32.png?ex=66ccc43a&is=66cb72ba&hm=76c3c15e29cdf68963a10fa31b0ba5327e2c5e165906d70b225319d32a9863c9&\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1277328053831336062/1277328351543169237/2024-08-25_18.25.45.png?ex=66ccc43a&is=66cb72ba&hm=01c7bdc9e2ecb1c27466caf32638fe818862d2e27a1bab23e6a91383e379809c&\" alt=\"\"></p>",
